        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty\r\nGaltymore \r\nSkeheenarinky  \r\nBurncourt  \r\nCo. Tipperary   \r\nE21 TD32\r\n\r\n\r\n4 Bedroom House. C.1,325sqft\r\nGuide: €450,000\r\nMichael Dorgan Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present this superb family home to the market, lovingly and diligently upgraded to BER A3 status over the last number of years at great expense. Boasting new GFCH, Solar panels, car charger, rewiring and replumbing. C.1acre landscaped site with areas set out in lawn, gravel, concrete & patio an insulated log cabin, office & workshop complete this extensive property. The location at the start of the Galtee climb is overwhelmed with the most breath taking of mountain & countryside views, yet is situated just off the R639/M8, 10minutes from Mitchelstown & Cahir, with Jack lynch Tunnel just 40mins.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nLocated just off the R639, a stones throw from the amenities of Kilbehenny village, less than 10minutes from Mitchelstown,  Limerick, Mallow, & Fermoy are all within a short drive.The M8 Motorway is easily accessed at Junction 12 (5minutes), with the property just 40minutes from the Jack Lynch tunnel. Despite such convenience the property benefits greatly from a picturesque scenic location, the most superb mountain views with the beginning of the Galtee climb on the door step & a generous site offering all the benefits of the countryside.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n4 bedroom detached house.\r\nExtensively refurbished.\r\nSolar panels, car charger.\r\nGas fired central heating.\r\nNew gas boiler with smart control.\r\nNew plumbing & electrics.\r\nNew bathrooms.\r\nTriple glazing, composite doors.\r\nSubstantial c.1acre site.\r\n24m2 log cabin (insulated)\r\nInsulated office, equipment shed.\r\nLog store and workshop.\r\nRecent water softener and steriliser.\r\nConcrete & gravel drive.\r\nExternal lighting. Alarm & cctv.\r\nFurniture available to purchase.\r\nGreen house, grape vines & apple trees.\r\nUnrivalled mountain views.\r\nJ12 M8 5 minutes.\r\nJack Lynch Tunnel 40mins.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nEntrance hallway   \r\n13.13m x 2.03m\r\n43ft x6.68 ft\r\nTimber floor.\r\nPower points, radiators.\r\nCornicing & roses.\r\nChandeliers.\r\nHot press (new tank).\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nKitchen/dining \r\n8.13m x 4.74m\r\n26.69ft x 15.53ft \r\nOpen plan space which includes living room\r\nWall & floor units.\r\nRecessed lighting.\r\nFloor tiles.  Tile back splash.\r\nPower points. \r\nBreakfast island.\r\nGas hob, built in oven.\r\nExtractor fan.\r\nIntegrated dishwasher.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLivingroom\r\nTimber floor.\r\nRadiator & Cover.\r\nChandelier & rose.\r\nBespoke window seat.\r\nPower points.\r\n  \r\n\r\nUtility\r\n2.42m x 2.00m\r\n7.94ft x 6.58ft\r\nWall & floor units.\r\nPlumbed for utilities.\r\nFloor tiles, power points.\r\nRecessed lighting.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n3.56m x 2.08m\r\n11.69ft x 6.83ft\r\nWet room type shower (elec).\r\nAntique style bathtub.\r\nVanity sink. WC.\r\nRadiator, fan heater.\r\nRecessed lighting.\r\nTiled floor to ceiling.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\n3.60m x 3.56m\r\n11.79ft x 11.68ft\r\nTimber floor.\r\nRadiator & power points.\r\nRecessed lighting.\r\nProjector.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nShared with bed 1 and 2 \r\n2.46m x 1.57m\r\n8.06ft x 5.15ft\r\nWet room type mains shower.\r\nWall & floor tiles.\r\nVanity sink.\r\nBidet WC.\r\nRecessed lighting.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.75m x 3.29m\r\n15.93ft x 10.79ft\r\nTimber floor.\r\nPower points & radiator.\r\nRecessed & wall lighting.\r\nMountain views.\r\nBlinds.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.54m x 3.43m\r\n11.62ft x 11.26ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points & radiator.\r\nBlinds\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n3.58m x 3.34m\r\n11.67ft x 10.96ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points & radiator.\r\nBlinds\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nCabin \r\n24m2\r\nTimber floor.\r\nPower points.\r\nElectric stove.\r\nInsulated, upgrade glazing.\r\n\r\nOffice \r\nTimber floor.\r\nPower points.\r\nInsulated, upgrade glazing.\r\n\r\nEquipment shed\r\nDouble doors\r\n\r\nGreenhouse\r\n\r\nFirewood Store\r\nCloths line\r\n\r\nWorkshop\r\nInsulated roof\r\nWater pump, softener & steriliser.\r\nPower points.\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms:\r\nGuide: €450,000\r\nThis property is being offered for Sale by private treaty. Terms are available and to   be negotiated on application with agents:\r\n\r\nMichael Dorgan \r\nAuctioneers & Valuers\r\nBaldwin Street\r\nMitchelstown\r\nCo. Cork\r\n\r\n(025) 85700\r\nEmail: Info@michaeldorgan    .i  e\r\n\r\nViewing: Strictly by Appointment only.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Michael Dorgan, Auctioneers & Valuers on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars but the company do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. Potential purchasers must clarify all information contained within marketing documents with their own engineers/surveyors and solicitors. Failure to do so cannot be considered the agents liability.\r\n All reasonable offers will be submitted to vendors. These particulars do not form any contract for Sale or lease subsequently entered into.\r\nInformation gathered from public sources may be subject to copy write, we are happy to acknowledge same if it becomes known to us.\r\nAny form of this brochure may not be reused"
      },
